  "bodyHash": "6c1a79e633ff44fe",
  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you would like translated into zh-CN.\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 整合包。用心制作。将 Serilum 的多个模组整合在一起，方便下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于该整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>The <strong>Quality of Life Bundle</strong> 是一种特殊的模组类型，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>QoL（生活质量）类</strong>模组整合在了一起。虽然将我的模组打包在一起非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让大家更方便地安装。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar / 嵌套 JAR）的系统。这意味着包含在内的模组在底层完全保持独立，同时允许像整合包一样将它们捆绑在一起进行安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你可以在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们全部被列出。<br><br>该整合包是包开发的额外辅助工具，但并不能替代我个人更喜欢的模块化模组系统。不过，你可以通过整合包的配置文件禁用其中包含的模组。<strong>修改后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的运作方式，它与正常安装该模组以及同时安装整合包内包含的模组完全兼容。这主要用于强制指定特定版本，但如果不小心通过这种方式重复安装了模组，也不会导致冲突。虽然可能不会出问题，但当然最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此整合包，可以移除其他已安装的、属于本整合包内的模组。<br><br>我希望这个整合包对偏好大型内容模组的玩家有所帮助。感谢大家多年来一直以来的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective 模组\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端与服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p><details><summary>显示详情</summary><span><strong>enableAlwaysaWitherSkull</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableAutomaticDoors</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBetterBeaconPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBetterConduitPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBetterSpawnerControl</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBottledAir</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCompactHelpCommand</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableConduitsPreventDrowned</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCyclePaintings</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableDismountEntity</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEasyElytraTakeoff</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEnchantingCommands</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableExtendedBoneMeal</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFurnaceRecycle</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableHoeTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableInventoryTotem</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableKeepMySoilTilled</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableKelpFertilizer</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMoveBoats</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMoveMinecarts</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNoAnimalTemptDelay</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNoFeatherTrample</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNutritiousMilk</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableOreHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableQuickPaths</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableQuickRightClick</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRecast</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableReplantingCrops</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRespawningShulkers</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableScaffoldingDropsNearby</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSleepSooner</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSofterHayBales</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableStackRefill</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableStickyEnchantingLapis</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSuperflatWorldNoSlimes</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSurfaceMushrooms</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableThornyBushProtection</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableTreeHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableUnderwaterEnchanting</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableVillageBellRecipe</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableWoolTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableYourItemsAreSafe</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableZombieProofDoors</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span></details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可用整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以下提供 Serilum 模组整合包：</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 客户端整合包</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 自定义整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 扩展整合包</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum QoL 整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum RPG 整合包</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 出生点整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/always-a-wither-skull.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/always-a-wither-skull\" target=\"_blank\">始终掉落凋灵骷髅头颅</a></td>\n<td>使凋灵骷髅死亡时必定掉落其头颅。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/automatic-doors.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/automatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\">自动门</a></td>\n<td>自动为玩家周围的门开门，并可通过配置设定延迟关门。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-beacon-placement.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-beacon-placement\" target=\"_blank\">更好的信标放置</a></td>\n<td>使用矿物方块右键点击信标即可轻松放置信标底座。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-conduit-placement.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-conduit-placement\" target=\"_blank\">更好的潮涌核心放置</a></td>\n<td>前置放置潮涌核心，使放置海晶石块等操作更轻松及其他优化。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-spawner-control.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-spawner-control\" target=\"_blank\">更好的刷怪笼控制</a></td>\n<td>当刷怪笼周围有 5 个火把时，会自动禁用该刷怪笼。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bottled-air.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bottled-air\" target=\"_blank\">瓶装空气</a></td>\n<td>允许玩家在水下使用空玻璃瓶呼吸以获取更多氧气。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/compact-help-command.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/compact-help-command\" target=\"_blank\">精简帮助命令</a></td>\n<td>修改 /help 命令以显示完整信息、彩色排版并支持多页浏览。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/conduits-prevent-drowned.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/conduits-prevent-drowned\" target=\"_blank\">潮涌核心防溺尸</a></td>\n<td>潮涌核心效果激活时，阻止玩家周围生成溺尸。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cycle-paintings.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cycle-paintings\" target=\"_blank\">循环画作</a></td>\n<td>手持另一幅画作右键点击已放置的画作即可轻松切换。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/dismount-entity.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dismount-entity\" target=\"_blank\">实体下马</a></td>\n<td>允许玩家在不破坏实体的情况下从骑乘实体上离开或移除其他实体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elytra-takeoff.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-elytra-takeoff\" target=\"_blank\">简易鞘翅起飞</a></td>\n<td>允许在地面无需跳跃即可使用烟花轻松启动鞘翅/Colytra 飞行。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/enchanting-commands.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-commands\" target=\"_blank\">附魔命令</a></td>\n<td>通过指令轻松创建（模组）附魔物品，附魔等级可突破默认上限。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extended-bone-meal.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/extended-bone-meal\" target=\"_blank\">扩展骨粉</a></td>\n<td>扩展骨粉功能。潜行瞬间催熟，支持催熟下界疣+仙人掌+甘蔗及其他优化。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/furnace-recycle.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/furnace-recycle\" target=\"_blank\">熔炉回收</a></td>\n<td>所有含金属物品均可在熔炉中回收并返回原材料。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hoe-tweaks.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hoe-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\">锄头优化</a></td>\n<td>加快作物方块破坏速度，增加锄头耕作半径，并支持翻耕还原土壤。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/inventory-totem.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/inventory-totem\" target=\"_blank\">背包图腾</a></td>\n<td>使不死图腾在背包任意位置均能触发保护效果。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/keep-my-soil-tilled.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/keep-my-soil-tilled\" target=\"_blank\">保持耕地状态</a></td>\n<td>收获藤蔓方块（西瓜/南瓜）后，下方耕地保持翻耕状态不 revert。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/kelp-fertilizer.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kelp-fertilizer\" target=\"_blank\">海带肥料</a></td>\n<td>海带藻类自然过滤海水获取丰富营养。海带可作为骨粉使用。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/move-boats.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/move-boats\" target=\"_blank\">移动船只</a></td>\n<td>允许玩家轻松移动船只而无需将其破坏。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/move-minecarts.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/move-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\">移动矿车</a></td>\n<td>轻松拾取并移动矿车而无需将其破坏。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/no-animal-tempt-delay.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/no-animal-tempt-delay\" target=\"_blank\">无动物引诱冷却</a></td>\n<td>移除使用目标食物引诱动物时的冷却时间间隔。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/no-feather-trample.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/no-feather-trample\" target=\"_blank\">羽毛防踩踏</a></td>\n<td>拥有羽毛/缓慢坠落效果时，防止耕地方块被踩踏。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/nutritious-milk.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/nutritious-milk\" target=\"_blank\">营养牛奶</a></td>\n<td>为牛奶添加营养值，食用后可恢复饥饿值和饱和度。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/ore-harvester.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ore-harvester\" target=\"_blank\">矿石收割机</a></td>\n<td>瞬间开采整个矿脉，并将矿石物品掉落至初始方块位置。是 Vein Miner 模组的更新替代方案。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/quick-paths.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quick-paths\" target=\"_blank\">快速路径</a></td>\n<td>设置起点和终点即可瞬间生成长路径。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/quick-right-click.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quick-right-click\" target=\"_blank\">快捷右键</a></td>\n<td>为特定物品添加便携功能，允许无需放置即可快速使用。适用于床、工作台、末影箱和潜影盒等。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/recast.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/recast\" target=\"_blank\">自动抛竿</a></td>\n<td>玩家钓到物品时自动重新抛出鱼线。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/replanting-crops.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/replanting-crops\" target=\"_blank\">自动复种</a></td>\n<td>使用锄头收割作物时，自动利用掉落物进行重新种植/替换/播种。支持模组掉落物、胡萝卜、马铃薯、甜菜根、下界疣、可可豆和小麦。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/respawning-shulkers.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/respawning-shulkers\" target=\"_blank\">潜影贝重生</a></td>\n<td>潜影贝会在配置设定的延迟后于死亡位置重生，可持续 farming 贝壳。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/scaffolding-drops-nearby.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/scaffolding-drops-nearby\" target=\"_blank\">脚手架就近掉落</a></td>\n<td>破坏脚手架方块时，所有相连的方块将在该位置掉落。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sleep-sooner.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sleep-sooner\" target=\"_blank\">更快入睡</a></td>\n<td>也可以更晚睡！允许玩家在不同时间段上床睡觉。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/softer-hay-bales.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/softer-hay-bales\" target=\"_blank\">柔软干草堆</a></td>\n<td>干草堆完全抵消坠落伤害，致敬《刺客信条》风格。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/stack-refill.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/stack-refill\" target=\"_blank\">自动补货</a></td>\n<td>当玩家使用最后一件物品且有替代品时，自动填满玩家的手。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sticky-enchanting-lapis.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sticky-enchanting-lapis\" target=\"_blank\">粘性青金石</a></td>\n<td>允许青金石保留在附魔台内并在玩家之间共享使用。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/superflat-world-no-slimes.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/superflat-world-no-slimes\" target=\"_blank\">超平坦世界无史莱姆</a></td>\n<td>在超平坦世界中发挥创意时，移除烦人的史莱姆。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/surface-mushrooms.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/surface-mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\">地表蘑菇</a></td>\n<td>允许蘑菇在白天和任意光照条件下直接放置于地表。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/thorny-bush-protection.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thorny-bush-protection\" target=\"_blank\">荆棘灌木保护</a></td>\n<td>穿着护腿的玩家穿过浆果丛时不会受到伤害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tree-harvester.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tree-harvester\" target=\"_blank\">树木收割机</a></td>\n<td>使用斧头瞬间砍伐整棵树木和巨型蘑菇。包含树叶快速腐烂和树苗自动放置功能。同样适用于诡异树（下界）。让你迅速成为砍树大师。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/underwater-enchanting.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/underwater-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\">水下附魔</a></td>\n<td>允许在水中通过书架达到最大附魔等级使用附魔台。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/village-bell-recipe.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/village-bell-recipe\" target=\"_blank\">村庄铃铛合成表</a></td>\n<td>使村庄铃铛物品可通过合成表制作。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/wool-tweaks.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wool-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\">羊毛优化</a></td>\n<td>对羊毛类方块配方、线转换及染色过程进行多项调整。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/your-items-are-safe.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/your-items-are-safe\" target=\"_blank\">物品安全</a></td>\n<td>玩家死亡时在原地生成一个箱子与盔甲架存放玩家物品，作为墓碑的替代方案。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-proof-doors.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-proof-doors\" target=\"_blank\">僵尸防破门</a></td>\n<td>阻止僵尸攻击并破坏门。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，您便可自由在任何整合包中使用此整合包。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
